          "end": 39.44,
          "relative_start": 31.44,
          "relative_end": 39.44,
          "en": "The fans. Tens of thousands of fans from across the globe are expected to visit the US, Mexico, and Canada for this extravagant experience.",
          "zh": "球迷们。预计将有来自全球的数万名球迷前往美国、墨西哥和加拿大，体验这场盛事。",
